"P268359964" "You know the difference between a slammer and scrammer, chompy? Scrammers scram, while slammers slam. I know, it seems really obvious, but that's cause you and I slam.<br><br>A birdie told us that some badgers are caging some scrammers down at Syfotine Industries. I don't know if they're secretly slammers like us, or just your average cubit, but either way, you bail them out, and we got karma buckets, you know what I'm sayin'?"
